{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10410","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 六 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋日登滑台，台高秋已暮。\n独行既未惬，怀土怅无趣。\n晋宋何萧条，羌胡散驰骛。\n当时无战略，此地即边戍。\n兵革徒自勤，山河孰云固。\n乘闲喜临眺，感物伤游寓。\n惆怅落日前，飘颻远帆处。\n北风吹万里，南雁不知数。\n归意方浩然，云沙更廻互。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}